text	parseRows turns each empty line into a row holding one empty field, so a text ending in a line break gets a stray empty row at the end. I'm changing it to produce no row for an empty line.  
Bash	D=<craft>/skills/github; bash $D/scripts/collect.sh take-in 91 bug,debt src/parser/read.ts parseRows "empty line" "empty row"; echo "exit $?"
